{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108986","id":2696645409,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6gu4sh","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108986","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108986.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108986.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108986","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108986/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108986/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108986/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8bbcb9f4fea4010a3cb4239b02925b75b8931c11","number":108986,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Save external resources before saving the scene","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`_save_external_resources()` is mainly used to save edited external resources.\r\n\r\nPreviously, `_save_external_resources()` was mainly called in `_save_scene()`, and `_save_scene()` usually needed to check scene changes before being called. When the scene is not modified, `_save_external_resources()` will not be called even if the resource is edited.\r\n\r\nIn this PR, after the action of saving the scene is triggered, `_save_external_resources()` will be called first, and then check whether to save the scene. And when `EditorNode` exits the scene tree, `_save_external_resources()` will also be called.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFix part of #101738, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101738#issuecomment-3094512007, reason 4.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-07-26T05:41:43Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:18Z","closed_at":"2025-08-01T16:52:13Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a1b5bcc9e1dffdbb3175670e727c6a5d08c8a55f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[]